<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CommitMate | 회원가입</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #030303;
            --primary: #ffffff;
            --accent: #6366f1;
            --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            --text-muted: #8a8a8a;
            --input-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: var(--bg); color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 100vh; overflow-x: hidden; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }

        .spotlight {
            position: fixed; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            width: 100vw; height: 100vh;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .signup-container {
            width: 100%; max-width: 440px; padding: 40px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 32px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 850; margin-bottom: 32px; letter-spacing: -1.5px; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; color: #fff; display: block; }
        .logo span { color: var(--accent); }

        .header-msg { margin-bottom: 32px; }
        .header-msg h2 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .header-msg p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; }

        .form-group { text-align: left; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .form-group label { display: block; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 8px; margin-left: 4px; }

        input {
            width: 100%; padding: 16px 20px;
            background: var(--input-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 14px;
            color: #fff; font-size: 15px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            outline: none;
        }
        input:focus {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.05);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
        }

        .btn-signup {
            width: 100%; padding: 16px; margin-top: 10px;
            background: var(--accent);
            color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 14px;
            font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
        }
        .btn-signup:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .auth-footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .auth-footer a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; margin-left: 5px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="spotlight"></div>

<div class="signup-container">
    <a href="/login-form" class="logo">CommitMate<span>.</span></a>

    <div class="header-msg">
        <h2>새로운 시작</h2>
        <p>나만의 커밋 동료들을 만나보세요.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- action은 컨트롤러의 회원가입 처리 주소와 맞춰야 합니다 -->
    <form action="/signup" method="post">
        <div class="form-group">
            <label>이메일 주소</label>
            <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="name@example.com" required>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>사용할 닉네임</label>
            <input type="text" name="nickname" placeholder="멋진 닉네임을 입력하세요" required>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <label>비밀번호</label>
            <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="8자 이상 입력하세요" required>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="btn-signup">계정 생성하기</button>
    </form>

    <div class="auth-footer">
        이미 계정이 있으신가요? <a href="/login-form">로그인</a>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>